      "id": "looker-studio-authoring",
      "kind": "builtin",
      "title": "Looker Studio authoring",
      "description": "Edits a Looker Studio / Data Studio report open in Edge or Chrome over CDP with the looker-studio MCP server: safe copies, layout, fields, source calculated fields, components, controls, filters, themes, pages and declarative report specs, with diagnosis and a UX audit. Six best-practice skills, a looker-studio-author subagent and /setup.",
